        "user_title": "Chief Justice",
        "title_is_group": false,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Here, by request, is a quick update on all of the publicly-known projects we are juggling! Remember, once something is sent to the printer, there is a 3-4 month turn-around time before we start shipping stuff to Kickstarter/preorder backers.</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Finished by GTG; At the Printer</strong></span></p><p>1) Guise/Wager Master/Omnitron-IV reprints</p><p>2) <em>Sentinel Miniatures: Minions</em> and <em>Sentinel Tactics</em> Location Maps</p><p>3) <em>Deck Building: The Deck Building Game</em> and <em>Unpub: The Unpublished Game</em></p><p>4) <em>Compounded</em> and the <em>Compounded: Geiger</em> expansion</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Nearly Completed by GTG; To Printer within ~4 Weeks</strong></span></p><p>1) <em>Villains of the Multiverse</em> and associated mini-expansions</p><p>2) New set of <em>Oversized Villain Cards</em></p><p>3) <em>Bottom of the Ninth</em></p><p>4) Reprint for <em>Isle of Trains</em></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>On Deck for Intense GTG Focus in Early Summer</strong></span></p><p>1) <em>Spirit Island</em></p><p>2) <em>Monster Truck Mayhem</em></p><p>3) More <em>Dice Hate Me</em> reprints</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>On Deck for Intense GTG Focus in Late Summer</strong></span></p><p>1) Sentinel Tactics: Battle for Broken City and For Profit</p><p>2) New Bedford and Don't Get Eated from DHM</p>",
